cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Continual Adversarial Training for Attack-Incremental IoT Intrusion
  Detection: code, audit tooling and per-run results
message: >-
  If you use this software or the evaluation-integrity audit, please
  cite both the software and the paper it accompanies.
type: software
