keywords:
  - intrusion detection
  - internet of things
  - adversarial machine learning
  - adversarial training
  - continual learning
  - class-incremental learning
  - catastrophic forgetting
  - data leakage
  - benchmark integrity
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Code, evaluation-integrity tooling and the complete per-run results
  (320 runs) for Continual Adversarial Training, a framework that places
  a PGD-TRADES inner maximisation inside a continual-learning loop for
  attack-incremental IoT intrusion detection. The audit tool measures
  per-class record diversity and held-out overlap for tabular IDS
  datasets; applying it disqualified one widely used benchmark and
  corrected a leakage defect in our own pipeline.
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/robotumbel/continual-adversarial-training-iot-ids
